This is an independent reproduction of the Git backend architecture ("Pando") that OpenAI described in
"Scaling Git at OpenAI" (https://openai.com/index/scaling-git-at-openai/). It is not OpenAI's code, is not
affiliated with or endorsed by OpenAI, and makes no claim of equivalence with OpenAI's system.
Most of the code was written by AI coding agents (Claude, by Anthropic) under the author's direction; see
PROVENANCE.md.

It contains no code from Git. It implements Git's documented network protocols and pack format, and calls a
user-installed `git` program as a separate process for optional recompression. Git is distributed under the GNU
General Public License, version 2; no part of it is included in or linked into this software.
"Git" is a trademark of the Software Freedom Conservancy; this project is not affiliated with it.

